  "title": "Victorian Greens seek urgent injunction over how-to-vote cards mimicking party’s branding but preferringencing it last",
  "summary": "Independent candidate Tosh-Jake Finnigan’s campaign team distributed how-to-vote cards that allegedly mimic the Liberal party’s branding, urging voters to prefer them last. The Victorian Greens are seeking an urgent injunction from the supreme court to stop the distribution.",
  "facts": [
    {
      "statement": "The Victorian Greens are seeking an urgent injunction from the supreme court to stop an independent candidate distributing how-to-vote cards that allegedly mimic the party’s branding and urge people to prefer them last.",
